# Wiki dock orientation: {{WIKI_NAME}}

This repo is docked to the **{{WIKI_NAME}}** wiki (companion
`{{COMPANION}}`): the wiki is this repo's durable memory - session
handoffs land there as append-only events, curated workstreams hold the
living state of each goal, and the garden pipeline keeps both clean.
This repo's `.wiki/` dock is only the pointer; the wiki holds the
content.

- Wiki root on this machine: `{{WIKI_ROOT}}`
- Dock identity: `.wiki/manifest.toml`; machine-local overlay:
  `.wiki/local.toml` (never committed, per the dock posture)
- Every kit CLI resolves the wiki through the dock: run commands from
  anywhere in this repo, no `--wiki` flag needed.
- Kit friction (a CLI, skill, or doc that misled you) is filed
  upstream in `{{KIT_ROOT}}/FEEDBACK.md`, never in the wiki; the
  `session-feedback` skill covers wiki-state contradictions only.

